                             lays out at page width, and the severity brushes are
                             pinned from code-behind because ThemeResource severity
                             lookups fail inside late-created section templates.
                             The message typography is also pinned from code-behind
                             (SettingsWindow.ApplyNoticeMessageTypography): the
                             template's Title/Message font sizes resolve through
                             StaticResource lookups inside the control library's
                             generic.xaml, so element-local resource overrides
                             cannot reach them. -->
                        <InfoBar
